# 统一按 LF 入库与检出。Windows runner 默认 core.autocrlf=true，会把工作副本写成 CRLF，
# 导致 vp fmt --check 全量报错、wails3 生成的 bindings 出现假的漂移差异。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾归一，也不参与文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.dmg binary
*.pfx binary
*.p12 binary
